{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301031","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301031","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430103101:1":{"text":"왜냐하면 준비한 음식 중에서 칠면조 다리만 사라졌거든!","source_cn":"因为准备的食物只有火鸡腿被吃了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DA7C3ADA6D147C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430103102:1":{"text":"칠면조 다리 말고도 깨끗이 손질한 반딧불이 열매도 잔뜩 있었는데!","source_cn":"那里除了火鸡腿，明明还有很多清洗干净的萤瓤果！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEC8EA34D32FD5F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430103103:1":{"text":"마을 전체에서 반딧불이 열매를 싫어하는 건 편식쟁이 그롬밖에 없어!","source_cn":"整个村子只有格罗姆最挑食，不喜欢萤瓤果！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB923066611930F32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:布朗德":{"text":"브랜드","source":"布朗德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}